usage: runner [-h] [--version] {doctor,install,configure,serve} ...

Local foundation commands; inspect/dry-run never install or authenticate
anything.

positional arguments:
  {doctor,install,configure,serve}
    doctor              Inspect prerequisites without external probes
    install             Report the installation plan only
    configure           Describe local setup and authorization gates
    serve               Run only the loopback health endpoint

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --version             show program's version number and exit
